{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"09d27a55e23f0042ba096ed63e33a748cb4e944e664ac5e7d437375198cfe694","digest":{"component_or_area":"rebar doctor mapping diagnostics","key_entities":["src/rebar/_commands/doctor.py","mapping_config.load_mapping_config","MappingConfigError","config.projects","effective_status_map","effective_type_map","assert_type_decisions_complete","effective_link_map","mapping_probe.build_probe","capability_installed","jira_datacenter","JIRA_PAT","resolve_jira_datacenter_settings","ConfigError","docs/user-guide.md"],"problem_keywords":["mapping config diagnostics","offline validation","live drift detection","jira datacenter","portable doctor command","config error reporting","degradation handling"],"propositions":["Offline mapping config validation must detect load-time errors (non-integer hierarchy, malformed axis/vocabulary blocks) and resolve-time errors (out-of-vocabulary values, unmapped-non-skipped entries) and surface them as error findings with MappingConfigError detail verbatim, causing non-zero exit.","Offline mapping config validation must detect all-empty projects.<KEY> blocks as warning findings (not errors) that do not cause non-zero exit.","Live-drift checking must degrade gracefully to a single unavailable finding when jira-datacenter extra is absent, PAT is unset, settings resolution raises ConfigError, or probe transport times out (with doctor-side bounded timeout, default 10s), succeeding with zero exit.","Live-drift checking must compare configured vs observed vocabulary (status, type, link) via the S8 probe reader and emit one drift finding per divergence naming the axis and absent value, excluding hierarchy because Data Center probe observes no hierarchyLevel.","Doctor mapping diagnostics must run offline-only path with no jira-datacenter import and only stdlib, maintaining portability when the extra is absent or credentials unset.","Mapping findings must be kept in their own separate list, rendered independently, and excluded from run_repair iteration to preserve the blocking-edge finding contract of doctor.scan()."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787892111915873001,"uuid":"d644d906-52e9-48b7-8e99-cd85cad64aab"}